# Phase discipline

Read [docs/master-spec.md](docs/master-spec.md) and the current phase doc before changing code.

Work only on the current phase. The current phase is Phase 11. See [docs/phase-11.md](docs/phase-11.md). Phase 10 is complete.

Do feature work on `develop`. Merge to `main` only when the user is ready for production.

Phase 11 adds PandaDoc online signing as an alternate Queensland channel, with parallel buyer and seller signing. Do not change or remove the Phase 10 offline pack flow. Do not add an FQ API, live Stripe keys, seller bank payouts, refund/chargeback workflows, or other jurisdictions’ real processes. Never trust the browser, a PandaDoc iframe, or a return URL for payment status, bid time, quota availability, signature completion, or transfer outcome. Never delete quota ledger rows.

Do not create later-phase tables or speculative architecture.

Keep dependencies minimal. Prefer the simplest solution that satisfies the current phase.

Stop at the end of each phase. After acceptance criteria pass, report results and wait for instruction.
